  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In a school, there are three types of games to be played. Some of the students play two types of games, but none play all the three games. Which Venn diagrams can justify the above statement?</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/509cfa4a-25c6-45af-a902-947544bc6baf-image.png\" style=\"width: 393px; height: 144px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "8H1oY",
      "text": "P and Q",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "qjUET",
      "text": "P and R",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "dtY2U",
      "text": "Q and R",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "XLE2T",
      "text": "None of these",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/bc2dc415-103d-44ab-8fd6-ef02992933b6-P.jpeg\" style=\"width: 197px; height: 200px;\" /></p><p>In P, the shaded region is lying in all the circles. It means some students play all the games.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/e636ffb9-329f-4a1f-8b08-7eaf9ba3ad01-Q.jpeg\" style=\"width: 198px; height: 200px;\" /></p><p>In Q, the shaded region is lying in all the circles. It means some students play all the games.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/a71d2359-935c-4d5c-8575-ec979cd91bb3-R.jpeg\" style=\"width: 204px; height: 200px;\" /></p><p>In R, the shaded region is lying in all the circles. It means some students play all the games.</p><p>Hence, none of the Venn&nbsp;diagrams justify the statement.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
